## What does this PR do?
- Add RigidBodyNotificationBus to BehaviorContext so you can receive OnPhysicsEnabled/OnPhysicsDisabled events in Lua
- Fix data loss warning as error

## How was this PR tested?

- Created a Lua script that used the events and made sure they fired via log output
```
local test = {
    Properties = {}
 }
 
 function test:OnActivate()
   self.handler = RigidBodyNotificationBus.Connect(self, self.entityId)
 end
 
 function test:OnPhysicsEnabled(entityId)
   Debug.Log("Physics enabled")
 end
 
 function test:OnPhysicsDisabled(entityId)
   Debug.Log("Physics disabled ")
 end
 
 function test:OnDeactivate()
   self.handler:Disconnect()
 end
 
 return test
```

